{"4535200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Harpooneer", "steam_appid": 4535200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Harpooneer, you swing your way to the top of the mountain using 2 Harpoon Guns, overcoming difficult environments and puzzles while constantly being at risk of losing massive progress if you should make even a small mistake and fall.<br><br>Have fun shooting harpoons, reeling them in, and detaching and doing it all over again as many times as it takes to get to the top of the mountain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535200/extras/a81a96f55fc66611a8ebc403fabd01a6.poster.avif?t=1775239276\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535200/extras/a81a96f55fc66611a8ebc403fabd01a6.webm?t=1775239276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535200/extras/a81a96f55fc66611a8ebc403fabd01a6.mp4?t=1775239276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><i>This game is not for the faint of heart, so do not mistake it to be something to complete in an afternoon. </i><br><br>This game is inspired by other popular &quot;rage games&quot;, such as <i>Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy</i>, <i>A Difficult Game About Climbing </i>and <i>Chained Together</i>. I grew up getting mad (and over) such games, and wanted my foray into indie development to be a game that I myself would have wanted to play when I was younger.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Harpooneer, you swing your way to the top of the mountain using 2 Harpoon Guns, overcoming difficult environments and puzzles while constantly being at risk of losing massive progress if you should make even a small mistake and fall.<br><br>Have fun shooting harpoons, reeling them in, and detaching and doing it all over again as many times as it takes to get to the top of the mountain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535200/extras/a81a96f55fc66611a8ebc403fabd01a6.poster.avif?t=1775239276\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535200/extras/a81a96f55fc66611a8ebc403fabd01a6.webm?t=1775239276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535200/extras/a81a96f55fc66611a8ebc403fabd01a6.mp4?t=1775239276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><i>This game is not for the faint of heart, so do not mistake it to be something to complete in an afternoon. </i><br><br>This game is inspired by other popular &quot;rage games&quot;, such as <i>Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy</i>, <i>A Difficult Game About Climbing </i>and <i>Chained Together</i>. I grew up getting mad (and over) such games, and wanted my foray into indie development to be a game that I myself would have wanted to play when I was younger.</p>", "short_description": "In HARPOONEER, shoot and swing your way to the top of the mountain as fast as possible, while falling as little as possible!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535200/774d4caa7785c38dcb174fd4bab48d383320d583/header.jpg?t=1775239276", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535200/e15504be7a16464fbc340ff0ec273b49002b2689/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775239276", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4535200/e15504be7a16464fbc340ff0ec273b49002b2689/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775239276", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-8400 / Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia  GTX 1060 / Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-12400 / Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 3060 / RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Brandon Harris-Lowe"], "publishers": ["Brandon Harris-Lowe"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 76, "description": "Mouse Only Option"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adv